p until it has\none, so do it deliberately rather than at the end of the day."]}]}],["$","li",null,{"children":["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Update the internal hops"}]," (worker to scheduler, ",["$","code",null,{"children":"grpc"}]," stores to upstream)\nto ",["$","code",null,{"children":"grpcs://"}]," with a matching ",["$","code",null,{"children":"tls_config"}],"."]}]}]]}]
46:["$","div",null,{"data-verify-block":"","className":"my-6 rounded-xl border border-success/40 bg-success-soft/50 px-5 py-4","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-foreground","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2.25","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"shrink-0 text-success","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}]}],"You did it right if"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"[&>p]:my-0 [&>p+p]:mt-2 [&>ul]:my-0","children":["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["A build against ",["$","code",null,{"children":"grpcs://"}]," succeeds and populates the cache."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["The same build against ",["$","code",null,{"children":"grpc://"}]," on the same port fails rather than silently\nfalling back."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["With ",["$","code",null,{"children":"client_ca_file"}]," set, a client with no certificate is rejected at the\nhandshake, not after."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":"Revoking a client certificate and adding it to the CRL locks that client out\nafter a restart."}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","code",null,{"children":"openssl s_client -connect host:50051 -alpn h2"}]," shows your chain and\nnegotiates ",["$","code",null,{"children":"h2"}],"."]}],"\n"]}]}]]}]
